00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.970
Shinigami exist only to shorten and take human lives.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.000
We aren't permitted to undo.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.540
That which has been fated.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:52.860
That moment, Jealous became something which was neither sand nor rust,

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.730
and disappeared forever.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.430
He died.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:19:00.000
The only reminder of his existence was his death note.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:08.930
left behind. The rest of his lifespan was added to hers. So not only had he saved her

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:13.110
life, he'd accidentally extended it well beyond its natural end.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:18.870
So if he'd never fallen in love with this girl, he'd probably still be alive today,

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.010
wouldn't he?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.490
That's right.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:30.000
Hmm. I had no idea. All this time I thought it was luck, but it was a Shinigami who

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:37.990
save my life that day. Yes. Jealous loved you enough to die for you. So that death

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:50.430
note is now yours to keep. Hmm. I see. For Shinigami to die, they have to love a

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:54.230
human enough that they'd prevent their death from happening. So what about you,

00:19:54.230 --> 00:20:00.000
Rem? You're not in love with me, are you? Be honest. Just forget it. You really think you

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.670
You can kill me that easily?

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.940
You saw through that?

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:07.150
I'm so glad.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:10.090
At least now I have something interesting to tell Kira.

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.710
But I wonder...

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.020
Does he know?

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.890
How to K-I-L-L Ashinigami?

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:20.070
I asked him on TV to find a way for us to meet each other,

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.830
but he hasn't replied to me yet.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.980
What's taking him so long?

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:26.370
Maybe I should just send him another message.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:34.740
This isn't good. I can't allow this second kida to act on his own for much longer.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:40.060
He's careless, so it's only a matter of time before he slips up, and when he does, the police will be waiting.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:43.850
With him in custody, they could find out about the death note.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:52.210
Something to start. Be right back.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:59.260
What should I do? How can I contact this second kida without El noticing anything?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.440
Here you go. Enjoy.

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.570
Wait to me, Kira.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.460
I wonder, what kind of person are you, imposter?

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.550
Wonder, what kind of person are you, Kira?

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.530
It's a dead end.

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:40.870
May 22nd, my friend and I showed off our notebooks in Aoyama.

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:43.270
If this fake kid slips up and gets apprehended,

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:46.130
at the very least I have to get my hands on his notebook.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:48.660
I may end up having to kill everyone there.
